ow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">他動詞</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たどうし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">他动词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75163\"><ruby>動詞<rp>(</rp><rt>どうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>目的語<rp>(</rp><rt>もくてきご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとらない<ruby>自動詞<rp>(</rp><rt>じどうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と、<ruby>目的語<rp>(</rp><rt>もくてきご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとる<ruby>他動詞<rp>(</rp><rt>たどうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在动词中,有不附着物体的反动词, 和确实附载物体的中转动词。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辿り着く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たどりつく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（历经艰辛）终于到达；（摸索前行后）抵达；好不容易到达；找到路抵达</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97358\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>丘<rp>(</rp><rt>おか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のふもとの<ruby>村<rp>(</rp><rt>むら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にたどり<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们到了山下的一个村庄</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辿る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たどる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沿着（道路等）；循着；追踪；追寻（线索、气味、足迹、情节等）；追溯（路线、历史、家谱等）；重温（记忆等）；搜索；查阅；朝向（某种状态）；走向；走上（某条路）；走上（某种命运）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145078\"><ruby>森<rp